<section class="fragment-benchmark" data-artifact="benchmark" data-slice="engine-core" data-mode="compare">
  <table class="bm-metrics">
    <thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th>Budget</th><th>Measured</th><th>Unit</th><th>Delta</th><th>Direction</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr data-tone="improved"><td>budget.match_wall_ms</td><td>2000</td><td>395</td><td>ms</td><td>-80.3%</td><td>lower is better</td></tr>
      <tr data-tone="improved"><td>budget.ticks_per_s</td><td>135000</td><td>683544</td><td>ticks/s</td><td>+406.3%</td><td>higher is better</td></tr>
      <tr data-tone="improved"><td>budget.tick_step_us</td><td>7.4</td><td>1.4615</td><td>us</td><td>-80.2%</td><td>lower is better</td></tr>
      <tr data-tone="neutral"><td>bench.cpu_ms_per_match</td><td>-</td><td>391</td><td>ms</td><td>first measurement</td><td>lower is better</td></tr>
      <tr data-tone="neutral"><td>bench.peak_mem_mb</td><td>-</td><td>5.05</td><td>MB</td><td>first measurement</td><td>lower is better</td></tr>
      <tr data-tone="improved"><td>budget.batch_1000_wall_min</td><td>30</td><td>6.6</td><td>min</td><td>-78.0% (projection)</td><td>lower is better</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <aside class="callout callout-info"><div class="callout-hd">Compare against the budget line</div><div class="callout-body">No code existed at baseline, so the budget column holds the NFR-1 budget from the shape. The measured column holds the medians verify measured on commit 27d21f5. No tripwire fired. The batch row is a projection from the single-match median; the calibration slice measures the batch.</div></aside>
  <style>
    .fragment-benchmark .bm-metrics { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .fragment-benchmark .bm-metrics th, .fragment-benchmark .bm-metrics td { text-align: left; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(127,127,127,0.25); }
    .fragment-benchmark .bm-metrics tr[data-tone="improved"] td:nth-child(5) { color: #1a7f37; font-weight: 600; }
    .fragment-benchmark .callout { margin-top: 12px; }
  </style>
  <script>
    (function () {
      var root = document.currentScript.closest('.fragment-benchmark');
      var metrics = root ? root.querySelectorAll('.bm-metrics tbody tr').length : 0;
      var improved = root ? root.querySelectorAll('.bm-metrics tbody tr[data-tone="improved"]').length : 0;
      window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('sdlc:fragment-ready', { detail: { name: 'benchmark', artifact: 'benchmark', counts: { metrics: metrics, regressions: 0, improvements: improved } } }));
    })();
  </script>
</section>
